- Modify `test/tickets.test.js` — one assertion.
- Modify `test/export-tickets.test.js` — one assertion (the export's output changes automatically once the ticket
  row does; this step only updates what the test expects).
- Modify `docs/glossary.md` — the "Assignee" entry.

`src/portal.js`, `src/store.js`, `src/jobs/export-tickets.js`, `src/jobs/close-resolved.js`, and
