# Phase 2 — Customer rates a resolved ticket

Blocked by: none.

## What this makes work

A customer can rate a resolved ticket of their own organisation once, with a whole-number score from 1 to 5; the
score and the time are kept with the ticket. A second rating, an out-of-range score, a not-yet-resolved ticket, or
another organisation's ticket are all refused. Check: `node --test test/ratings.test.js` green.

